 2. 🛒 DoorDash eyes $17B Instacart takeover 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 Illustration: Tiffany Herring/Axios DoorDash is in "advanced talks" to acquire rival Instacart, The Wall Street Journal reports .

 The deal, which could value Instacart at around $17 billion, could be finalized this week, but may still fall apart. 🚗 Instacart primarily offers at-home delivery from grocery stores and retailers. DoorDash made its name through restaurant deliveries.

 DoorDash is also working on an in-house drone delivery program, Axios' Joann Muller reports . Gift link . 

 
 
