 4. 🐶 1 fun thing: Robot dog walkers wanted 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 Illustration: Annelise Capossela/Axios San Francisco startup Dimensional recently posted an unusual help-wanted ad seeking walkers for robotic dogs, The New York Times reports . 

 🤖 The company is working on ways to integrate AI agents and robots.

 "Dimensional compared how the robot dogs performed when walking around under human control with how they did when controlled by an AI agent, and found the latter lacking," The Times reports. Founder Stash Pomichter said: "What we determined from our dog-walking experiment was that agents are still very bad at controlling hardware."

 "And humans are still needed in the loop." Gift link . 

 
 
